        "subject": "LU-6689 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_MIGRATE_SRC flag",
        "message": "LU-6689 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_MIGRATE_SRC flag\n\nReserve OBD_CONNECT2_MIGRATE_SRC at 0x400000000000ULL for an MDT\nthat refuses a migration early when the source has no layout ops.\nOnly the flag, obd_connect_names[] and the wire checks are added\nhere so the value can land before the feature patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I1a5f604f6169412de6e34a92ae5a6635824e96e0\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
